## Backport PR #83 — PGE Evaluator stage for owl-generator (onto develop)

Context: PR #83 added a Planner→Generator→Evaluator loop to `agent_owl_generator`:
after the pitfall-tool loop, deterministic Stage-1 checks (orphan classes, dangling
domain/range, naming violations, duplicate classes) feed bounded retry hints back to
the model. The branch was rebased onto `develop` (not `master`), reconciling with the
existing 8192-token budget, truncation guard, and class-cap guard landed in 0.7.0.

Changes:

1. src/agents/agent_owl_generator/engine.py
   Merged PGE evaluator stage (`_evaluate_ontology_stage`, `MAX_OWL_EVAL_ROUNDS`),
   ATTRIBUTE COVERAGE prompt, and `owl_eval_max_rounds` option; kept `_GEN_MAX_TOKENS=8192`.
2. src/agents/pge_eval/__init__.py
   New package root for intrinsic PGE evaluation primitives.
3. src/agents/pge_eval/normalize.py
   Shape normalisation and footprint helpers (stdlib-only).
4. src/agents/pge_eval/ontology_metrics.py
   `evaluate_ontology()` — deterministic Stage-1 metrics and retry hints.
5. tests/units/pge_eval/
   Unit tests for ontology metrics and evaluator stage wiring.
6. tests/units/agents/test_agent_owl_generator_truncation.py
   Structurally valid completion fixture; disable PGE loop in isolated guard tests.
7. tests/units/agents/test_agent_owl_generator_class_cap.py
   Disable PGE loop via `owl_eval_max_rounds: 0` when isolating class-cap guard.
8. .planning/agents/agent_owl_generator/SPEC.md
   Document PGE evaluator failure mode and `max_owl_eval_rounds`.
9. tests/eval/datasets/agent_owl_generator/regression.jsonl
   Add `regression-pge-orphan-class-003` for Stage-1 structural defects.

