## Clarify wizard monitoring error after server reload

Context: Ontology wizard polling showed a generic "Error monitoring task" when the
dev server hot-reloaded mid-generation. Tasks live in memory only; a reload drops
the task ID (`83fad989` → 404) and kills the background generation thread.

Changes:

1. src/front/static/ontology/js/ontology-wizard.js
   Detect 404 / not_found during task polling and show a clear "server restarted"
   message instead of a generic monitoring failure.

